# Test code inherits the project checks, minus three that only fire inside
# Catch2's macros (TEST_CASE expands to a static function; CHECK/REQUIRE expand
# to do-while loops; TEMPLATE_TEST_CASE registers each instantiation through a
# static object whose constructor may throw).
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-do-while,
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization
...
